<title>UK: Schleswig-Holstein Hypo sets 500 mln mark bond.</title>
<headline>Schleswig-Holstein Hypo sets 500 mln mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager DG Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SCHLESWIG-HOLSTEINISCHE LANDESCHAFT HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    15.JAN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     FLAT	PAY DATE  S 14.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  20 BP     ISSUE	100.18    LISTING     HAMBURG</p>
<p> NOTES    S-SHORT FIRST COUPON OF 1M-LIBOR FLAT TO 14.APR.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 631</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
